.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Hana found out she could push things without
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]touching them the day her bicycle chain snapped
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]on a hill.
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]The pendant she found afterward lets her become
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]the Gale.
.L 367.69 37.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Short, with a red scarf she never takes off;
.L 377.69 37.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]as the Gale, a grey coat that never stops
.L 387.69 37.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]moving.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Cheerful and stubborn, and quick to take
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]a dare.
.L 542.79 37.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Owes the shrine keeper a favor.
